{"4464550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HOP-CO-OP", "steam_appid": 4464550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [4525450], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HOP-CO-OP</strong> is a first-person bunny-hop parkour game about chaining jumps, building ridiculous speed, and never touching the brakes — solo or with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the Movement</strong> Learn bunny hopping mechanics inspired by classic FPS movement. Build speed through strafe jumps, navigate tricky platforms, and push your skills to the limit across increasingly difficult parkour courses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Together</strong> Team up with friends in online co-op or compete head-to-head. Race through maps together, battle with powerups like freeze rays, mines, and ink bombs, or play Bomb Tag — pass the bomb before it explodes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Games Room</strong> Take a break from parkour and visit the games room! Play card games, spin the wheel, and try your luck on Coinflip. Earn and spend your in-game currency for cosmetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Character</strong> Unlock hats, skins, and cosmetics to make your character stand out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Own Maps</strong> Create and share custom parkour maps with the built-in level editor. Design your dream course and challenge others to beat it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person bunny hop parkour gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer co-op and PvP</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerup battles with 15+ items (freeze, fire, mines, ink, homing rockets, and more)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bomb Tag game mode (pass the bomb — don't be holding it when it explodes!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Games room</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization with unlockable cosmetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in map editor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple handcrafted maps with varying difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tutorial to learn the movement basics</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HOP-CO-OP</strong> is a first-person bunny-hop parkour game about chaining jumps, building ridiculous speed, and never touching the brakes — solo or with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the Movement</strong> Learn bunny hopping mechanics inspired by classic FPS movement. Build speed through strafe jumps, navigate tricky platforms, and push your skills to the limit across increasingly difficult parkour courses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Together</strong> Team up with friends in online co-op or compete head-to-head. Race through maps together, battle with powerups like freeze rays, mines, and ink bombs, or play Bomb Tag — pass the bomb before it explodes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Games Room</strong> Take a break from parkour and visit the games room! Play card games, spin the wheel, and try your luck on Coinflip. Earn and spend your in-game currency for cosmetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Character</strong> Unlock hats, skins, and cosmetics to make your character stand out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Own Maps</strong> Create and share custom parkour maps with the built-in level editor. Design your dream course and challenge others to beat it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person bunny hop parkour gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer co-op and PvP</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerup battles with 15+ items (freeze, fire, mines, ink, homing rockets, and more)</p></li><li><p class=\